<p class="fig-cap">Filled dots: the 8 training points. Open dots: 7 unseen test points from the same curve. The line is the model.</p>

| Model | Training MSE | Test MSE | Verdict |
|---|--:|--:|---|
| Degree 1 | 1.48 | 0.74 | underfits |
| Degree 2 | 0.24 | 0.13 | fits |
| Degree 7 | 0 | 2.99 | overfits |

Degree 7 passes through every training point (training error 0) and has the worst test error: it learned the noise. Degree 1 cannot bend, so it is poor on both. Degree 2 matches the true shape and is best on unseen data. **Zero training error is not the goal.**

